<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (Australia has been resettling refugees with permanent visas through an offshore program since the 1970s, primarily referred by the UN Refugee Agency \(UNHCR\). Refugees may also be eligible for a Special Humanitarian Program visa \(subclass 202\) if they have a proposer in Australia and meet eligibility requirements. The government determines the annual number of visas granted, as well as the countries and cases given priority.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
